### Get all products
GET http://localhost:8080/products

### Get products by category
GET http://localhost:8080/products?category=MOTOR

### Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

### Get my products (auth required)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create product (auth required)
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "BMW E46 első lökhárító",
  "price": 25000,
  "category": "KAROSSZERIA",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/image.jpg"
}

### Update product (auth required)
PUT http://localhost:8080/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "BMW E46 első lökhárító - felújított",
  "price": 20000,
  "category": "KAROSSZERIA",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/image.jpg"
}

### Delete product (buy / auth required)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
